# Build context is the repo root (devcontainer.json build.context ".."). None of
# these are COPYed into the image; excluding the large/churny trees only speeds up
# the repo-root context walk on rebuilds.
#
# Two rules, both learned the hard way — do NOT add a path that breaks either:
#  - Never list anything the Dockerfile COPYs (.devcontainer/certs/,
#    bootstrap_ubuntu.sh, bootstrap_python.sh) — the COPY would find nothing.
#  - Never list a build tool's own scratch dir (.devpod-internal/) — DevPod COPYs
#    it into its feature-injection stage; filtering it exits the build with 125.
.git/
build/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
test/output/
